Hello everyone -

All previous subscribers to mptcp@lists.01.org have been moved to the new 
mptcp@lists.linux.dev mailing list. Everyone (except patchwork...) has 
been unsubscribed from the old lists.01.org list.

You can unsubscribe at any time by emailing 
mptcp+unsubscribe@lists.linux.dev

List archives (going back to 2017) are at https://lore.kernel.org/mptcp/, 
and mptcp@lists.linux.dev is the point of contact in the MAINTAINERS file 
for Linux 5.12 and later.


The one remaining task is to reconfigure our Patchwork project at 
https://patchwork.ozlabs.org/project/mptcp/list/ but the admins there have 
been slow to respond. Please continue to cc mptcp@lists.01.org for patch 
submissions and replies to those patches.

